# Dedicated release weight area is intentionally allowlisted. Add weights there
# only after verifying that they are model checkpoints, not feature tensors.
!release/
!release/weights/
!release/weights/**

# Upstream repositories are kept as local working copies and referenced by
# commit in release/DEPENDENCIES.md; do not embed their nested Git metadata.
/CLAM/
/Patch-GCN/

# Keep the lightweight benchmark definition, summaries and verified release
# checkpoints even though generic split/result/weight patterns are ignored.
!baseline/
!baseline/adenoma_11class/
!baseline/adenoma_11class/splits/
!baseline/adenoma_11class/splits/**
!baseline/adenoma_11class/results/
!baseline/adenoma_11class/results/**
!baseline/adenoma_11class/weights/
!baseline/adenoma_11class/weights/**
